# real ASCII-armored fbtech-nos apt repository signing public key before
# this can be used for anything but a dry run.
#
# The real key is produced by the package-build pipeline (a separate branch
# / workflow from this one - see docs/FORK-PLAN.md milestone 2) and
# published at:
#   https://ericgullickson.github.io/fbtech-nos/fbtech-nos-archive-keyring.asc
#
# Until that key lands here, live-build has nothing valid to import for the
# `deb {vyos_mirror} {vyos_branch} main` entry that build-vyos-image
# generates at build time (see scripts/image-build/build-vyos-image,
# VYOS_REPO_FILE), so any package installs from that repository will fail
# apt's signature check. This is expected and tracked in
# docs/TRIXIE-BASE.md.
